 "_doc": "NPC id -> 3D model scene. Agent 1 drops scenes at game/art/models/npcs/<id>/<id>.tscn (or edit 'scene' here) and NpcLife picks them up with NO code change; until a scene exists the NPC is a baked FallbackVisual silhouette. Scene root must be Node3D, feet at y=0, facing -Z. Optional duck-typed API on the root: set_facing(Vector3 dir), set_move_amount(0..1). Otherwise an AnimationPlayer anywhere under the root is driven by name: 'anim' maps NpcLife states (idle, walk, work, rest) to clip names (missing clips fall back to idle). 'scale' multiplies the model, 'height_m' sizes the name tag and speech bubble anchor.",
